        aboutTitle:"About Dwarkamai Sanstha", aboutIntro:"Dwarkamai Bahuuddeshiya Sevabhavi Sanstha works toward educational and social development in remote and rural areas, especially for economically weaker students facing financial or social difficulties. Its work includes educational materials, technical training, sports development, counseling, women’s empowerment, environmental awareness, and rural development. The organization works with tribal, Katkari, and other disadvantaged children while identifying educational, intellectual, physical, mental, and economic needs.",
