        activitiesTitle:"Our Activities", activitiesIntro:"Documented activities and continuing social work of Dwarkamai Sanstha. Beneficiary counts are omitted unless verified.", dehaneTitle:"Dehane Impact Story", dehaneLocation:"Location: Dehane, Bhimashankar region", dehaneCopy:"Dehane is a tribal and remote region. The Zilla Parishad School teaches Grades 1–4 using two classrooms: Grades 1 and 2 together, and Grades 3 and 4 together.\n\nSupport provided includes a water filter; warm jackets; drawing materials; sketch pens; pencils; water colours; brushes; sports dresses stitched to children’s measurements; pens; pencils; erasers; rulers; nutritious snacks; steel plates; and steel spoons. Food-grain kits were also provided to tribal communities during the COVID period.",
